    "Hard" : {
      "comment" : "Difficulty level",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Těžká"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hint" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nápověda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hint asks the engine for the move it would play, in games against the computer; with two players that button offers a draw instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nápověda se zeptá enginu, jaký tah by zahrál, v partiích proti počítači; u dvou hráčů totéž tlačítko nabízí remízu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Games End" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jak partie končí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the Pieces Move" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jak táhnou figury"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Play" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jak hrát"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hungarian Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uherská obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hungarian Opening" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uherské zahájení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If I play this, what is the best reply?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když zahraju tohle, jaká je nejlepší odpověď?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the player to move has no legal move but is not in check, the game is a draw — stalemate. It is the great escape of the losing side, so when you are far ahead, give the enemy king air and mate him properly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pokud hráč na tahu nemá žádný možný tah, ale není v šachu, je partie remíza — pat. Je to velký únik prohrávající strany, takže když vedete o hodně, nechte soupeřovu králi vzduch a dejte mu pořádný mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in check" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value on the checked king's square",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "v šachu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the first ten moves, aim to have every knight and bishop off its starting square and pointing at the centre. A piece at home does nothing, and material means little if your opponent's army is developed and yours is not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V prvních deseti tazích se snažte dostat každého jezdce a střelce z výchozího pole a namířit je do středu. Figura doma nedělá nic a materiál moc neznamená, když má soupeř vyvinutou armádu a vy ne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inaccuracy" : {
      "comment" : "Move grade",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nepřesnost"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inaccurate — %@ held on to more.%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nepřesné — %@ udržel víc.%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indian Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indická obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is anything of mine attacked and undefended?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Není něco mého napadené a nekryté?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It does not matter whether the rook is attacked, or whether the rook crosses an attacked square." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na věži nezáleží — může být napadená i přejít přes napadené pole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is the piece that gets out of a crowded position most easily." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ze zaplněné pozice se dostane ven nejsnáz ze všech figur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Italian Game" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Italská hra"
