            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Půlnoc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missed chance" : {
      "comment" : "Move grade",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Promarněná šance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mistake" : {
      "comment" : "Move grade",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chyba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modern Benoni" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moderní Benoni"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modern Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moderní obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most games between beginners are decided by pieces given away for nothing, not by deep plans. Four quick questions prevent nearly all of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie začátečníků rozhodují zadarmo darované figury, ne hluboké plány. Čtyři rychlé otázky tomu skoro vždy zabrání."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MOVE BREAKDOWN" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ROZDĚLENÍ TAHŮ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move each pawn only as far as your pieces need." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Každým pěšcem táhněte jen tak daleko, jak vaše figury potřebují."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move numbers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Čísla tahů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move taken back" : {
      "comment" : "Spoken by VoiceOver after Undo",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tah vrácen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tahy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving pieces, hints and the game review" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tahy figurami, nápověda a rozbor partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearly the engine's choice; %@ was a shade better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skoro volba enginu; %@ byl o chlup lepší."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither player can deliver checkmate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ani jeden hráč už nemůže dát mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither the king nor that particular rook has moved yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král ani ta konkrétní věž ještě netáhli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never played before? Start at the top. Nine short lessons cover every rule of the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nikdy jste nehráli? Začněte nahoře. Devět krátkých lekcí projde všechna pravidla hry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nová partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Další"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimzo-Indian Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nimcoindická obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimzowitsch Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nimcovičova obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No dots: Black has no legal move at all. Checkmate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Žádné tečky: černý nemá jediný možný tah. Mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No moves played" : {
      "comment" : "Stands in for the accuracy of a player who never got to move",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez tahů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No moves to review — this game ended before anyone played." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Není co analyzovat — partie skončila, než padl první tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No verdict for this move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pro tento tah není hodnocení."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not analyzed yet" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value before the engine has answered",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zatím nerozebráno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough material: king against king, or king and a single knight or bishop, cannot mate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nedostatek materiálu: král proti králi, nebo král s jedním jezdcem či střelcem, nemůže dát mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not in check, but nothing to play: a draw." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Není v šachu, ale nemá co hrát: remíza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "notation.pieceLetters" : {
      "comment" : "The five piece letters used when a move is written down, in the order king, queen, rook, bishop, knight — no separators. Czech chess writes KDVSJ (král, dáma, věž, střelec, jezdec).",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KDVSJ"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KQRBN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O-O is castling towards the h-file, O-O-O towards the a-file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O-O je rošáda na stranu sloupce h, O-O-O na stranu sloupce a."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ocean" : {
      "comment" : "Board theme",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oceán"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On one device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na jednom zařízení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once per game each player may castle: the king steps two squares towards a rook and that rook hops over him to the other side. It is the only move that shifts two pieces at once, and it does two useful things — the king hides behind his pawns and the rook comes into play." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jednou za partii může každý hráč rošovat: král udělá dva kroky směrem k věži a ta přeskočí na jeho druhou stranu. Je to jediný tah, který hýbe dvěma figurami najednou, a dělá dvě užitečné věci — král se schová za své pěšce a věž se dostane do hry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One number covers a move by each player: \"1.e4 e5\" is move one. When only Black's half is quoted it is written with dots, as in \"1...e5\". The strip under the board in this app lists the game exactly this way, newest move last." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedno číslo pokrývá tah obou hráčů: „1.e4 e5“ je první tah. Když se cituje jen půlka černého, píše se s tečkami, třeba „1...e5“. Pruh pod šachovnicí v této aplikaci vypisuje partii přesně takhle, nejnovější tah vpravo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One step at a time — but in every direction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vždy jen krok — zato všemi směry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Game" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otevřená hra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening principles and simple plans" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zásady zahájení a jednoduché plány"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overloading: a defender given two jobs cannot do both." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přetížení: obránce se dvěma úkoly nezvládne oba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owen's Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Owenova obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pauza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pawn" : {
      "comment" : "Piece name",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pawn Promotion" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Proměna pěšce"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pawns cannot go back: think twice before you push one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšci se nevracejí: než některým postoupíte, rozmyslete si to dvakrát."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pawns fill the second rank in front of the pieces. Rooks go in the corners, then knights, then bishops, and the king and queen take the last two squares. The queen always starts on a square of her own colour: the white queen on light d1, the black queen on dark d8." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšci vyplní druhou řadu před figurami. Do rohů patří věže, pak jezdci, pak střelci a poslední dvě pole zaberou král s dámou. Dáma vždy začíná na poli své barvy: bílá na světlém d1, černá na tmavém d8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petrov's Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ruská hra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Philidor Defense" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Philidorova obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piece artwork" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grafika figur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piece plus square" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Figura a pole"
          }
        }
