      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slovanská obrana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sokolsky Opening" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sokolského zahájení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Solid" : {
      "comment" : "Verdict on a player's accuracy",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solidní"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound, if not the sharpest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solidní, i když ne nejostřejší"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sounds" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zvuky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "square.empty" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for an empty board square",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@, prázdné"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@, empty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "square.occupied" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for a square with a piece on it",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@, %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate — draw" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pat — remíza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate is a draw" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pat je remíza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate: no legal move, but no check either." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pat: žádný možný tah, ale ani šach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Začátek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Začít partii"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start New Game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Začít novou partii"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting position" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Výchozí pozice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step through the game to see how each move was judged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projděte partii tah po tahu a uvidíte hodnocení každého z nich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still being analyzed…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ještě se analyzuje…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Straight lines, any distance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rovné linie, libovolná vzdálenost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the board, or tap a move in the strip, to walk through the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partii projdete přejetím po šachovnici nebo klepnutím na tah v pruhu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the centre" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obsaďte střed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking a knight instead of a queen is rare, but it can come with a check that a queen would not give." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vzít si jezdce místo dámy je vzácné, ale může s sebou nést šach, který by dáma nedala."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a dot to move the pawn." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepnutím na tečku pěšcem táhnete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a piece and the dots show every square it may legally go to; tap one of them to play the move. Dragging the piece works too, and tapping it a second time puts it back down. Illegal moves are simply not offered, so you cannot go wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na figuru a tečky ukážou každé pole, kam smí podle pravidel jít; klepnutím na tečku tah zahrajete. Funguje i tažení figury a druhé klepnutí ji zase položí. Nedovolené tahy se prostě nenabízejí, takže nemůžete udělat chybu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap e4 to open the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepnutím na e4 zahájíte partii."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap e8: the pawn arrives and becomes a queen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na e8: pěšec dojde a promění se v dámu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap g1 or c1: the king goes two squares, the rook lands on his other side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na g1 nebo c1: král jde o dvě pole a věž přistane na jeho druhé straně."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the knight: it is pinned and has no legal move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na jezdce: je vázaný a nemá žádný možný tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app shows the captured pieces and the material lead next to each player." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace ukazuje u každého hráče sebrané figury a materiální náskok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bishop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Střelec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bishop keeps to its own colour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Střelec zůstává na své barvě."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Board" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Šachovnice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The boards in the lessons are live: tap a piece's dots and the move really happens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Šachovnice v lekcích jsou živé: klepněte na tečku u figury a tah se opravdu zahraje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The buttons" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tlačítka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The classic game of kings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klasická hra králů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The columns are called files and are lettered a to h." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sloupce se značí písmeny a až h."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The endgame" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koncovka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine is still working through the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Engine partii ještě prochází."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's own first choice" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "První volba enginu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fifty-move rule: fifty moves by each side with no capture and no pawn move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pravidlo 50 tahů: padesát tahů každé strany bez braní a bez tahu pěšcem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The five draws" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pět druhů remízy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fork" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vidlička"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four squares both sides are fighting over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Čtyři pole, o která obě strany bojují."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game ended by resignation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie skončila vzdáním."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game review" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rozbor partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game waiting under Continue will be lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie čekající pod tlačítkem Pokračovat bude ztracena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gear — in the menu, and in the top row of a game — holds five board themes, sounds and haptics, and the two helpers you may want to switch off as you improve: the legal-move dots and the coordinates around the board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ozubené kolo — v menu i v horní řadě partie — skrývá pět vzhledů šachovnice, zvuky a vibrace a dva pomocníky, které možná budete chtít s rostoucí silou vypnout: tečky možných tahů a souřadnice kolem šachovnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highlighted square is e4." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zvýrazněné pole je e4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king does not pass over, or land on, a square an enemy piece attacks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král nepřechází přes napadené pole ani na něm nekončí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king has nowhere to run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král nemá kam utéct."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king is not in check right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král právě není v šachu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king is safest behind an untouched wall of pawns, and castling puts him there while bringing a rook towards the centre. As a rule: develop two or three pieces, castle, then start looking for a plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král je nejbezpečnější za nedotčenou hradbou pěšců a rošáda ho tam dostane a zároveň přivede věž ke středu. Jako pravidlo: vyviňte dvě tři figury, zarošujte a teprve pak hledejte plán."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king moves one square in any direction. He is never actually captured: instead the rules forbid leaving him under attack, so a move that would expose your own king is simply not allowed. The two kings can also never stand next to each other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král táhne o jedno pole libovolným směrem. Nikdy se vlastně nebere: pravidla místo toho zakazují nechat ho pod útokem, takže tah, který by vlastního krále vystavil, prostě není dovolen. Oba králové také nikdy nesmějí stát vedle sebe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king must step aside, and the rook collects the queen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král musí uhnout a věž si vezme dámu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knight" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jezdec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knight moves in an L: two squares along one line, then one square across. It is the only piece that jumps — nothing in between can block it, and it always lands on a square of the opposite colour to the one it left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jezdec táhne do L: dvě pole po jedné linii a pak jedno stranou. Je to jediná figura, která skáče — nic mezi tím ji nezastaví — a vždy dopadne na pole opačné barvy, než ze kterého vyšla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last finished game stays on the menu, so you can review it again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poslední dohraná partie zůstává v menu, takže si ji můžete prohlédnout znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move that cost the game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tah, který stál partii"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one move that held everything together" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jediný tah, který vše udržel pohromadě"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn captures sideways" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšec bere šikmo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vazba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The player to move has no legal move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hráč na tahu nemá žádný možný tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The point of the whole game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O co v celé hře jde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dáma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queen is a rook and a bishop in one: any distance along a rank, a file or a diagonal. She is far and away the strongest piece, which is also why she should not go hunting alone in the opening — smaller pieces chase her around and gain time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dáma je věž a střelec v jednom: libovolná vzdálenost po řadě, po sloupci i po diagonále. Je zdaleka nejsilnější figurou, a právě proto by se v zahájení neměla vydávat na lov sama — menší figury ji ženou před sebou a získávají tempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rook" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Věž"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rook has exactly one legal move: e4, blocking the check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Věž má přesně jeden možný tah: e4, který šach zacloní."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rows are called ranks and are numbered 1 to 8." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Řady se značí čísly 1 až 8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules, from the first move" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pravidla od prvního tahu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same position occurred three times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stejná pozice nastala potřetí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skewer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rentgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The squares between them are empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pole mezi nimi jsou volná."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The standard Staunton chess pieces drawn by Cburnett for Wikimedia Commons, used under the BSD licence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardní Stauntonovy šachové figury nakreslil Cburnett pro Wikimedia Commons, použito pod licencí BSD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest move — it forces mate in %lld." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejsilnější tah — vynucuje mat %lld. tahem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest move in the position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejsilnější tah v pozici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two kings face each other on the e-file, the two queens on the d-file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oba králové stojí proti sobě na sloupci e, obě dámy na sloupci d."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are two ways to win: checkmate the enemy king, or have your opponent resign. Resigning is normal courtesy among players once a game is hopeless — the Resign button is in the row under the board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyhrát jde dvěma způsoby: dát soupeřovu králi mat, nebo se dočkat, až se soupeř vzdá. Vzdát se je mezi hráči běžná slušnost, jakmile je partie beznadějná — tlačítko Vzdát najdete v řadě pod šachovnicí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no rule that you must take a piece, and no rule that pieces must be defended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neexistuje pravidlo, že se musí brát, ani že figury musí být kryté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was mate in %lld with %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Byl tu mat %lld. tahem po %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "thinking" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: the computer is searching",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "přemýšlí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app asks which piece you want as soon as the pawn lands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace se zeptá, jakou figuru chcete, hned jak pěšec dojde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the most common way a beginner's game is lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Takhle začátečníci prohrávají nejčastěji."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three Special Moves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tři zvláštní tahy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three ways out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tři způsoby, jak ze šachu ven"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threefold repetition: the same position, with the same player to move, for the third time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trojí opakování: stejná pozice se stejným hráčem na tahu potřetí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To mate, drive the enemy king to the edge and bring your own king up to help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "K matu zatlačte soupeřova krále na kraj a přiveďte na pomoc vlastního krále."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "to move" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: this player is on turn",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "na tahu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top right, the gear opens the settings and the arrows flip the board; the chevron at the top left returns to the menu, keeping the game so you can continue it later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vpravo nahoře otevře ozubené kolo nastavení a šipky otočí šachovnici; šipka vlevo nahoře se vrátí do menu a partii uloží, abyste v ní mohli později pokračovat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tournament" : {
      "comment" : "Board theme",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turnajová"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trade with a purpose" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyměňujte s rozmyslem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trompowsky Attack" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trompowského útok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the board so that each player has a light square in the near right corner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otočte šachovnici tak, aby měl každý hráč v pravém dolním rohu světlé pole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.focusHint" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the piece a lesson is about",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tahy této figury jsou na šachovnici označené."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The moves of this piece are marked on the board."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.focusValue" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver summary of a lesson diagram that offers a piece's moves",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ na %2$@, nabízené tahy jsou označené"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ on %2$@, the moves on offer are marked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Twenty-seven squares from d5." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dvacet sedm polí z d5."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two armies, 64 squares" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dvě armády, 64 polí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two pieces checking at once (a double check) can only be answered by moving the king." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na dvojšach (šach dvěma figurami najednou) se dá odpovědět jedině tahem krále."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two Players" : {
      "comment" : "Game mode",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dva hráči"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two players · move %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dva hráči · %lld. tah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two rooks or three minor pieces are worth roughly a queen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dvě věže nebo tři lehké figury mají zhruba cenu dámy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the board are the three controls you need during a game, and the top row takes you back to the menu or spins the board around." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pod šachovnicí jsou tři ovládací prvky, které během partie potřebujete, a horní řada vás vrátí do menu nebo otočí šachovnici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zpět"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo takes back your move — and the computer's reply with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zpět vezme váš tah nazpět — a s ním i odpověď počítače."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unfinished game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nedohraná partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Values are a guide, not a law: an active knight can be worth more than a passive rook." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hodnoty jsou vodítko, ne zákon: aktivní jezdec může mít větší cenu než pasivní věž."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Van 't Kruijs Opening" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Van 't Kruijsovo zahájení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "verdict.excellent" : {
      "comment" : "Verdict on a player's accuracy",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vynikající"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Excellent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very good" : {
      "comment" : "Verdict on a player's accuracy",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Velmi dobré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vienna Game" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vídeňská hra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vs Computer · %@" : {
      "comment" : "Game mode, with the difficulty level",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Proti počítači · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "W" : {
      "comment" : "One-letter abbreviation for White",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "B"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What did that last move threaten?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Co hrozí po soupeřově posledním tahu?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Nf3 and O-O mean" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Co znamená Jf3 a O-O"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the pieces are worth" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jakou mají figury hodnotu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a game is over, Game Review plays it back and has the engine grade every single move, with an accuracy score for each player and a graph of who was winning when. It is the fastest way to find out what actually went wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když partie skončí, Rozbor partie ji přehraje a nechá engine ohodnotit každý jednotlivý tah, s přesností pro každého hráče a grafem, kdo kdy stál lépe. Je to nejrychlejší způsob, jak zjistit, co se doopravdy pokazilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a piece attacks the enemy king, that is check. Nothing else may be done first: the player in check has to answer it with this move. Here the rook on e1 checks along the open e-file, so the black king must leave that file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když figura napadne soupeřova krále, je to šach. Nic jiného se předtím dělat nesmí: hráč v šachu na něj musí odpovědět právě tímto tahem. Tady dává věž na e1 šach po otevřeném sloupci e, takže černý král musí ze sloupce pryč."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When castling is allowed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kdy je rošáda dovolena"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White ahead by %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: White's advantage, in pawns",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bílý vede o %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White has castled: king tucked in, rook joining the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bílý zarošoval: král v bezpečí, věž se zapojuje do hry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White mates in %lld" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: a forced mate for White",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "few" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Bílý dává mat v %lld tazích"
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Bílý dává mat v %lld tahu"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Bílý dává mat v %lld tazích"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "White mates in %lld"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "White mates in %lld"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White resigned" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bílý se vzdal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winning" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Výhra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winning Material" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Získávání materiálu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wins, draws and the fifty-move rule" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Výhry, remízy a pravidlo 50 tahů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With few pieces left the rules of thumb change. Pawns become precious, because one that gets through becomes a queen, and the king turns into a strong piece that should march towards the action instead of hiding." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S málo figurami na desce se pravidla palce mění. Pěšci jsou najednou vzácní, protože ten, který projde, se promění v dámu, a z krále se stává silná figura, která má vyrazit do dění, ne se schovávat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wood" : {
      "comment" : "Board theme",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dřevo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "x is a capture: Bxc6, or exd5 for a pawn taking on d5." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "x je braní: Sxc6, nebo exd5, když bere pěšec na d5."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You" : {
      "comment" : "Player name",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You resigned" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vzdali jste se"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You win by checkmate!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyhráváte matem!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zukertort Opening" : {
      "comment" : "Chess opening",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
